uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_683890534781612_1845730143550472367_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vZIV5QZnQ3IQ7kNvwEp5UJL&_nc_oc=AdrJa4k7d2lKj8yw3ak7jo1ORjJs72HBN6cRd65Q1cj2-M-OgvS5u30pSv3NBZhlfZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2oxGwZuv3ALW5xYsqFGlNeizKylsW1Bdn2D7p86iriXg&oe=69D63164"}, {"file_name": "3 SC- upgrade.png", "id": "1089105139847913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1089105146514579_4248858233085192791_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yt-pzohMfG0Q7kNvwFh1xBv&_nc_oc=AdrbD95JjKLzh8oLeOIk6ECC7jWQbZLLk042oDttJ0mfpbTP0ausuUpgAu8uvnlqfHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3TPtGO-2ydAbpK3u0mqEPIr_bWnNxcH68k79YzKvu_Iw&oe=69D64D2C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_03_Combat.png", "id": "910125081636304", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_910125084969637_8062525329240909942_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LaAU4JQTWpoQ7kNvwEAJoT7&_nc_oc=Adpod8FiHa5KecvtSKo0WFlWaklzzhr8r3JVUWc3SzxbhooDRj0ZG_wm5umZFvH2KiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af08XKxCcvQd8-zjsR8-_tXtX2sErbbnDzTR_ID40WzUag&oe=69D64C1C"}, {"file_name": "Screen_02_Combat.png", "id": "782108887855752", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_782108891189085_1310893654474811832_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SkBtJCierZAQ7kNvwGg6U_N&_nc_oc=AdoMX43N8w2-QXlAfcfCYZCH9DgsVL-NsUYHge2-lfCGUfJUdCjEnWRkgO-5XHVtxaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af345EEvCUHeCM4FBRRncC_h33mushp1sSNWm7Ac4SqPzA&oe=69D63F9D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "2692830891061149", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_2692830894394482_8747474291273843826_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FkFt73eGvJEQ7kNvwEaxqSW&_nc_oc=AdrkwdvAoFsLHui4QWxUIc2Lo7BccGNcnSMWFOS75KVFGYVp8wr632NOHUrepevNocA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af35aN_yM_5sY2EKsx121axqExKJ0uc6lTnNHx74UhbORA&oe=69D644CF"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne", "keywords": ["Shooter", "roguelike", "Hell", "Demons"], "long_description": "# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{2188548808336788}\n# Become Godlike!\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{747652215014871}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1178417621063675}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1591134325586122}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.\n\n", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy.html", "devel